<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Conta pendente de aprovação — BiblioMap</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex">

    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d1117">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: #060b14;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        /* Ambient glow */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed; inset: 0;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 0%, rgba(210,153,34,.08) 0%, transparent 70%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 80% 80%, rgba(59,130,246,.05) 0%, transparent 60%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* ── Top brand ── */
        .brand {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeDown .5s .05s ease both;
        }
        .brand img { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 9px; }
        .brand-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #e2e8f0; }

        /* ── Card ── */
        .card {
            position: relative;
            background: #0d1520;
            border: 1px solid #1e2d45;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 52px 48px 44px;
            max-width: 540px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeUp .5s .15s ease both;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        /* Top accent bar */
        .card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d29922, #f0883e, #d29922);
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            animation: shimmer 3s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shimmer { 0%{background-position:200%} 100%{background-position:-200%} }

        /* ── Icon ── */
        .icon-wrap {
            position: relative;
            width: 88px; height: 88px;
            margin: 0 auto 32px;
        }
        .icon-ring {
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid rgba(210,153,34,.3);
            animation: ringPulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .icon-ring-2 {
            position: absolute;
            inset: -10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid rgba(210,153,34,.15);
            animation: ringPulse 2.5s .4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes ringPulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1);   opacity: 1; }
            50%       { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: .5; }
        }
        .icon-core {
            width: 88px; height: 88px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(210,153,34,.15), rgba(240,136,62,.15));
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 38px;
        }

        /* ── Status badge ── */
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
            padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(210,153,34,.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(210,153,34,.35);
            color: #d29922; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .status-dot {
            width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: #d29922;
            animation: blink 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:.25} }

        /* ── Headings ── */
        h1 {
            font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800;
            color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: -.4px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 15px; color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .subtitle strong { color: #94a3b8; }

        /* ── Blocked access notice ── */
        .blocked-notice {
            display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px;
            background: rgba(239,68,68,.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            text-align: left;
            margin: 28px 0 24px;
        }
        .blocked-icon {
            width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0;
            background: rgba(239,68,68,.12);
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 18px; color: #f87171;
        }
        .blocked-text { font-size: 13.5px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.65; }
        .blocked-text strong { color: #f87171; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 14px; }

        /* ── Steps ── */
        .steps {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.02);
            border: 1px solid #1e2d45;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .step {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
            padding: 14px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1a2740;
        }
        .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .step-indicator {
            width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .step-indicator.done {
            background: rgba(16,185,129,.15);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(16,185,129,.4);
            color: #10b981;
        }
        .step-indicator.current {
            background: rgba(210,153,34,.15);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(210,153,34,.4);
            color: #d29922;
        }
        .step-indicator.future {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            border: 1.5px solid #1e2d45;
            color: #475569;
        }
        .step-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
        .step-title { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .step-title.muted { color: #475569; }
        .step-desc { font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; }
        .step-time {
            font-size: 11px; color: #d29922; font-weight: 600;
            background: rgba(210,153,34,.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(210,153,34,.2);
            padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* ── Actions ── */
        .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .btn-secondary {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
            padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #1e2d45; background: transparent;
            color: #64748b; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none; transition: all .2s;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #3b82f6; color: #3b82f6; background: rgba(59,130,246,.05); }
        .btn-home {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
            padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 10px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            border: 1px solid #1e2d45;
            color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none; transition: all .2s;
        }
        .btn-home:hover { border-color: #2d3f5a; color: #e2e8f0; }

        /* ── Footer note ── */
        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 28px;
            font-size: 12px; color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ── Animations ── */
        @keyframes fadeUp   { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px) } to { opacity:1; transform:none } }
        @keyframes fadeDown { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(-12px) } to { opacity:1; transform:none } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="brand">
        <img src="/logo.svg" alt="BiblioMap">
        <span class="brand-name">BiblioMap</span>
    </a>

    <div class="card">

        <div class="icon-wrap">
            <div class="icon-ring-2"></div>
            <div class="icon-ring"></div>
            <div class="icon-core">⏳</div>
        </div>

        <div class="status-badge">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            Conta aguardando aprovação
        </div>

        <h1>Seu cadastro foi recebido!</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
            Sua conta foi criada com sucesso, mas <strong>o acesso ainda não está liberado</strong>.
            Um administrador precisa revisar e aprovar o seu perfil antes de você poder usar a plataforma.
        </p>

        <div class="blocked-notice">
            <div class="blocked-icon">
                <i class="bi bi-lock-fill"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="blocked-text">
                <strong>Acesso bloqueado até aprovação</strong>
                Enquanto sua conta estiver pendente, você <em>não conseguirá fazer login</em> na plataforma.
                Aguarde a liberação — ela será feita manualmente pelo administrador.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-indicator done">
                    <i class="bi bi-check-lg"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="step-body">
                    <div class="step-title">Cadastro realizado</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">Seus dados foram recebidos com sucesso.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-indicator current">
                    <i class="bi bi-hourglass-split"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="step-body">
                    <div class="step-title">Análise pelo administrador</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">Seu perfil está na fila de aprovação.</div>
                </div>
                <span class="step-time">até 48h</span>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-indicator future">3</div>
                <div class="step-body">
                    <div class="step-title muted">Acesso liberado</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">Você poderá fazer login e usar a plataforma.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
            <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-secondary">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i>
                Tentar login
            </a>
            <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="btn-home">
                <i class="bi bi-house"></i>
                Página inicial
            </a>
        </div>

        <p class="footer-note">
            Dúvidas? Entre em contato com o administrador da plataforma.<br>
            Não tente fazer login enquanto seu acesso não for aprovado.
        </p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
